cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use projectmem in your research or writing, please cite the paper
  below. To cite a specific release of the software, use the metadata in this
  file.
title: "projectmem"
type: software
abstract: >-
  projectmem is coding agent memory: a local-first memory and judgment layer
  for AI coding agents. It records issues, attempts, fixes, decisions and notes
  as typed events in plain text, serves them to agents through a native MCP
  server, and warns at git commit time before an approach that already failed
  is repeated.
